    "detailed_description": "The Top is a simple precision platformer about climbing a mountain.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 levels designed to both teach and test player ability, with assist modes for those less inclined to platformers.<br></li><li> A simple narrative that runs as deep as you're willing to follow it.<br></li><li> Visual style based off the color palette of the original GameBoy.<br></li><li> An original ambient chiptune soundtrack written to accompany the game and its story.<br></li><li> Secrets.</li></ul>",
